154
00:10:49,208 --> 00:10:51,625
Bawa kunci, jaga-jaga kalau aku tertidur.

155
00:11:40,916 --> 00:11:43,250
-Bagus, bukan?
-Sangat bagus.

156
00:11:46,416 --> 00:11:48,291
